echo — echo arguments
======================

Reads the argument string and outputs it.
Used to test argument passing to external programs.

    module oskit.bin.echo

    import oskit.ulib.{get_args, putc, exit, PROG_ARGS_ADDR}

    main()
        val args = get_args()
        val p = *byte(args)
        for var i = 0; i < len(args); i++
            putc(int(p[i]))
        putc('\n')
        exit()
